<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Bourse closed for Moslem Eid.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Bourse closed for Moslem Eid.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Stock Exchange and banks were closed on Monday for Eid al-Fitr marking the end of the Moslem fasting month of Ramadan.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
